        "text": "Done. `index.html` is written \u2014 a single self-contained file, all CSS inline, no external assets.\n\n**Design rationale (grounded in Marrow's own world):**\n\n- **Signature element \u2014 the coverage grid.** Marrow maps test coverage, so each card carries a small matrix of cells in its corner: sparse and dim on Solo, fully lit and accent-glowing on the recommended Team card, fully covered on Enterprise. The feature bullets are the same coverage-cell squares. This is the one place boldness concentrates.\n- **CLI personality.** Monospace (`ui-monospace`) drives every technical touch \u2014 the `$ marrow plans --all` kicker, tier labels, prices' periods, and `\u203a`-prefixed CTA buttons \u2014 while a tight grotesk-style sans handles the big \"Pricing\" headline and price amounts.\n- **Palette (disciplined, 6 values):** deep terminal ink `#0C0F14`, warm \"bone\" text `#ECE6D9` (the marrow), muted greys, one signature marrow-coral accent `#FF6A3D`, and a covered-cell teal `#57C7A6` for feature ticks.\n- **Structure encodes meaning.** \"Everything in Solo/Team\" renders as an *inherited* line \u2014 mono, prefixed `+` \u2014 visually distinct from net-new features. The Team card is elevated, accent-bordered, badged, and reordered to the top on mobile.\n- **Motion with restraint:** staggered card entrance and hover lift only; fully disabled under `prefers-reduced-motion`, with visible focus rings on all interactive elements.\n\nResponsive down to a single column at 860px, with the recommended tier floating to the top."
